<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Knightsbridge said started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Knightsbridge said started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber started coverage of Knightsbridge Tankers Ltd on Monday with an attractive rating, according to a source at the brokerage.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 24 on Friday.</p>
<p>-- The Bermuda company owns very large crude carrier oil tankers (VLCCs) and is an affiliate of ICB Shipping BF of Sweden.  It went public in early February at an IPO price of $20.</p>
</text>
